      "seed": 1438816725,
      "version": 229,
      "versionNonce": 1353472507,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1749699353151,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Instagram Auction Post\n- ability to auction items on instagram\ne.g. sell a t-shirt via a post, make bids\nauctions end at a certain date/time -> highest bid wins\n\n(don't worry about payments/shipping)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 142,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Instagram Auction Post\n- ability to auction items on instagram\ne.g. sell a t-shirt via a post, make bids\nauctions end at a certain date/time -> highest bid wins\n\n(don't worry about payments/shipping)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "a2",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "oJwoxZ4h_h_CB0Td0dlyJ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1839.8037269124168,
      "y": 325.3061166489333,
      "width": 566.6195068359375,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 576362293,
      "version": 257,
      "versionNonce": 933585563,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1749699353151,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirements:\n1. Create an auction post\n2. Users can submit bids on an auction\n3. Determine and notify auction winner at end of auction\n4. Users can view latest bid on an auction in real time\n\n-------- \nfeed generation",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 192,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirements:\n1. Create an auction post\n2. Users can submit bids on an auction\n3. Determine and notify auction winner at end of auction\n4. Users can view latest bid on an auction in real time\n\n-------- \nfeed generation",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "a3",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "9UsYIw9ePsdAW57Z3SD7D",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1843.440528401184,
      "y": 568.2437855934083,
      "width": 382.19976806640625,
      "height": 275,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 164358293,
      "version": 408,
      "versionNonce": 934565691,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1749699353151,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Non-Functional Requirements:\n1. strong consistency for bids\n2. low latency bid updates (<500ms)\n3. scalable up to 10M auctions / day \n  - read >> write\n\nScale:\nO(10M) auctions ongoing / day\nmany views / few bids\n\n-----",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 267,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Non-Functional Requirements:\n1. strong consistency for bids\n2. low latency bid updates (<500ms)\n3. scalable up to 10M auctions / day \n  - read >> write\n\nScale:\nO(10M) auctions ongoing / day\nmany views / few bids\n\n-----",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "a4",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "bvyHXM5l3sQLVEYpGpe5w",
      "type": "text",
